# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# 云端大模型方案（DeepSeek）：质量更好、不占本地内存，按 token 计费
#   cp .env.cloud.example .env && docker compose up -d --force-recreate
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
HOST_PORT=8010
LLM_API_KEY=sk-在这里填你的Key
LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
LLM_MODEL=deepseek-chat
LLM_TEMPERATURE=1.3
LLM_CONCURRENCY=6
LLM_TIMEOUT=120
LLM_RETRIES=2
LLM_NO_THINK=0
LLM_MAX_TOKENS=0
GLOSSARY_ENABLED=1
GLOSSARY_MODE=match
LLM_MOCK=0
TRANSLATE_MAX_CHARS=1800
TRANSLATE_REFS=0
MAX_UPLOAD_MB=80
DATA_DIR=./data
TZ=Asia/Shanghai
